      47.85,
      403.69,
      540.05,
      510.76
    ],
    "text": "BY VIRTUE of the powers vested in me by Sub Section (3) of Section 2 of the Mutual Assistance in Criminal Matters Act, No.25 of 2002, I, Wijeyadasa Rajapakshe, Minister of Justice, do by this Order declare that the provisions of the aforesaid Actshall apply in respect of the Agreement between the Government of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka and theGovernment of the People\u2019s Republic of China made at Colombo on the Sixteenth day of September Two Thousand andFourteen. This Agreement which was made between the Government of Sri Lanka and the Government of the People\u2019sRepublic of China, which is a Non-Commonwealth Country, deals with Mutual Legal Assistance in criminal matters andconcerns inter alia the improved effectiveness on the part of both parties to the Agreement through cooperation in relationto the prevention, investigation, prosecution and judicial proceedings, including organized crimes within their respectivejurisdications.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
